ns Workspace","target":"workspace-dashboard-use","line":24},{"title":"Add alert table to enable on-call scheduling for Service Operations Workspace for ITOM","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/service-operations-workspace-for-itom-apps/add-alert-table-oncall.md","line":28},{"title":"Create on-call shift for your team","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-service-management/on-call-scheduling-in-sow.md","line":32},{"title":"Add alert table to enable on-call scheduling for Service Operations Workspace for ITOM","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/service-operations-workspace-for-itom-apps/add-alert-table-oncall.md","line":34},{"title":"Configuring Service Operations Workspace for ITOM","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/service-operations-workspace-for-itom-apps/configure-sow-itom.md","line":37},{"title":"Service Operations Workspace","target":"workspace-dashboard-use","line":41}],"metadata":{"title":"On-call scheduling in Service Operations Workspace for ITOM","description":"ITOM Service Operations Workspace supports creating and managing your on-call shifts and schedules. On-call schedule determines who is on-call at a given time. Learn how to configure on-call calendars and escalation policies to ensure timely responses to critical issues, reducing downtime and maintaining service continuity. Streamlining these processes enhances team readiness, minimizes disruptions, and improves service reliability.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/it-operations-management/service-operations-workspace-for-itom-apps/oncall-schedule-escalation.html","release":"australia","product":"Service Operations Workspace for ITOM Apps","classification":"service-operations